      "@type": "BlogPosting",
      "@id": "https://securetools.live/blog/check-whether-your-pdf-is-encrypted#article",
      "headline": "How to Check Whether a PDF Is Encrypted",
      "description": "A PDF may open without a password and still contain encryption or permission restrictions; determine exactly what protection exists before relying on it. Identify the mechanism and its limits rather than treating the word encrypted as a security guarantee.",
